# A heavy thing with no hand strong enough for it and no bag to take it is refused like a full pack.
#
# The Test Rack's iron bar is heavy, and with --organs arms=0 each hand bears light things only
# (PartyMember.HoldLimit). The seed-42 kit carries nothing that would contain the bar, so
# CanAcquire refuses before the dice, naming the weight rather than the room — the same refusal
# path InventoryCapacityRule takes for a full pack. grab/success.cli is the same scene with arms=2.
#
# FLAGS: --playground --skip-childhood --debug --seed 42 --no-encounters --auto-dialogue --location-type test --location-id 0 --start-area "Test Yard" --period dawn --observe-only "Test Rack" --organs arms=0

wait
click menu New
wait mode ProtagonistCreation 20
click continue
wait mode WorldView 60
travel here
wait mode LocationInteraction 60

strategy succeed
goal grab
advance 12 180

click keyword 0
choose 0
choose 0
advance 12 180

click action 0
choose 0
advance 12 180

# Refused before any roll: no banner, no item, nothing applied.
expect-not SUCCESS
expect too heavy for my arms
expect-not Item received:
expect-no-outcome item_acquisition
expect-no-state items iron_bar
dump
quit
